WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.237
Aunt Sunny's family is coming for the wedding.

2
00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:15.456
We got to meet them.

3
00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:20.183
Sunny: Mom! Dad! It's so good to see you!

4
00:00:20.184 --> 00:00:22.658
Mother: Sunny! How are you?

5
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:24.679
You look beautiful!

6
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.619
Father: You look wonderful, dear!

7
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:32.082
Sunny: Let me introduce you to my best friend, Young-Hee.

8
00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:35.123
Mom: Hello. It's nice to meet you.

9
00:00:35.124 --> 00:00:37.567
Father: And what's your name?

10
00:00:37.568 --> 00:00:39.704
Hana: My name is Hana.

11
00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:41.784
Nice to meet you.

12
00:00:41.785 --> 00:00:45.034
Bada: And I'm Bada.

13
00:00:45.035 --> 00:00:47.850
Sunny: This is my sister, Sherry.

14
00:00:47.851 --> 00:00:51.063
Sherry: I've heard so much about you.

15
00:00:51.064 --> 00:00:53.206
Mother: Where are you from?

16
00:00:53.207 --> 00:00:57.060
Hana: We're from Korea.

17
00:00:57.061 --> 00:01:01.695
Hana: How many brothers and sisters does Aunt Sunny have?

18
00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:05.387
Mom: She has one sister and one brother.

19
00:01:05.388 --> 00:01:07.898
Hana: Where is her brother?

20
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:11.379
Mom: He is living in France.

21
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.617
Father: How old are you, Bada?

22
00:01:14.618 --> 00:01:16.655
Hana: He's seven years old.

23
00:01:16.656 --> 00:01:19.063
And I'm ten.

24
00:01:19.064 --> 00:01:25.022
Mother: So, Hana, I heard you are going to be the flower girl.

25
00:01:25.023 --> 00:01:29.454
Hana: Yes. I have a beautiful pink dress.

26
00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:33.210
Bada: I want to be a flower girl too!

27
00:01:33.211 --> 00:01:39.110
Father: You can't! It's for girls only!

28
00:01:39.111 --> 00:01:42.332
Sherry: The big day is coming up, Sunny.

29
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:45.856
Sunny: I know! It's so exciting.

30
00:01:45.857 --> 00:01:49.443
Hana: I can't wait for your wedding, Aunt Sunny.

31
00:01:49.444 --> 00:01:53.675
Mom: It's going to be a beautiful wedding.

32
00:01:53.676 --> 00:02:00.426
Aunt Sunny's family is so nice!
